          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋiyi Isarela kansi, namukeŋeli, natambikili mwanami weyalaafumi muEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinabadikili kuyitambika hiyakubadika kuya mwacheŋi. Hiyakuketwila aBayali yimuna, akishi akusoŋa hiyakuyochela yamavumba amawahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoŋa nalejeli Efweremi kwenda, yami; nayakatili hamakasami; kwinza kwiluka nawu yami nayukili nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayikokeli nanyonji yeyala, yonyonji yakukeŋa. Kudi wena nadiŋi neyi chaduwu antu akufumisha mpanda hayibaŋa yawu, nayibandaminini nakuyidiisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafunta cheŋi mwituŋa daEjipituku, kaAshuri diyi wakekala mwanta wawu, nanochu chalekeluwu kufunta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoku yakabali yakazuwila nyikala yindi, yakanoŋesha nyikomenu yindi, yakayivwota hansaŋu jampùŋa jatiyaŋenuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ami ata muchima hakuselumukila hanyima afumi kudami. Hela neyi akuyitúumbakesha kudi wekala mwiwulu, kwosi muntu wakamutúumbakesha yenaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Efweremi, nitweshi ŋahi kukulekela akwankunyi? Eyi Isarela, nitweshi ŋahi kukuhana? Nitweshi ŋahi kukufwikŋa neyi Adima? Nitweshi ŋahi kukukoŋa neyi Zeboyimi? Muchima hiwukubalumuka mwivumu, ami nasweji dehi kutiya wushona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinakakoŋa mwaya kuzuwa kwami kwaswejaku, hinakafunta cheŋi nakujilumuna aEfweremuku; muloŋa ami niNzambi, hinimuntuku, yami Wajila mukachi kenu; hinakenza mumukala nandombuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akenda munyima yaYehova, yena wakabuluma neyi mutupa; chakabulumayi anyanindi akafuma kumuji ka, akenza nakuzaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akafuma muEjipitu, akenza neyi kajila nakuzaala, akafuma kuAshuri neyi katela; nakayishakamisha mumatalawu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi hakunnyeŋu mwisha kutwamba, akwamutaŋa waIsarela niwena hiyakunnyeŋumwisha makasu. Ilaŋa Yuda wuchidi kuyula naNzambi yindi, amumona kushinshika kudi Wajila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
